{"n": 63, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "63.webp", "text": "40 11086\n\n11-35\n\nCounterhold pulley with the drive belt,\nunscrew bolts and take off pulley.\n\nUnscrew bolts on vibration damper\nand take off vibration damper.\n\ninstallation:\n\nAlign dowel pin bore in vibration\ndamper with the dowel pin precisely.\nTightening torque = 23 Nm (17 ft. ibs.).\n\nDrain coolant.\n\nNote:\nFill and bleed cooling system - see\nGroup 17.\n\nUnscrew screws.\nTake off thermostat housing and\nthermostat.\n\nInstaliation:\nCheck O-ring (1), replacing If neces-\n\nsary.\nInsert thermostat with the O-ring fac-\ning the hoysing.\n\nUnscrew screws and take off lower\ntoothed drive belt cover.\n\nInstatlabon.\nCheck gasket, replacing If necessary.\n\nUnscrew screws and take off upper\ntoothed drive belt cover.\n\ninstallation:\n\nCheck that dowel sleeves are installed\narid-seated correctly In the area of the\nupper bolts.\n\nTurn crankshaft to move valves of\ncylinder no. 1 to TOC.\n\nHold crankshaft In TDC with Special\nTool 11 2 300.\n\nCaution!\nRemove special too! before operating\nthe engine.", "words": [["40", 0.1986, 0.9695, 0.2092, 0.9781], ["11086", 0.2133, 0.9708, 0.2386, 0.9788], ["11-35", 0.4686, 0.0305, 0.5248, 0.0544], ["Counterhold", 0.2715, 0.0743, 0.3384, 0.0855], ["pulley", 0.3425, 0.0743, 0.3744, 0.0882], ["with", 0.3779, 0.0743, 0.3997, 0.0855], ["the", 0.4043, 0.0743, 0.42, 0.0855], ["drive", 0.424, 0.0743, 0.4504, 0.0855], ["belt,", 0.4539, 0.0743, 0.4767, 0.0875], ["unscrew", 0.2715, 0.0928, 0.3171, 0.1021], ["bolts", 0.3212, 0.0908, 0.3475, 0.1021], ["and", 0.3511, 0.0908, 0.3708, 0.1021], ["take", 0.3749, 0.0908, 0.3967, 0.1021], ["off", 0.4002, 0.0908, 0.4144, 0.1021], ["pulley.", 0.4184, 0.0908, 0.4534, 0.1048], ["Unscrew", 0.2715, 0.3077, 0.3181, 0.319], ["bolts", 0.3222, 0.3077, 0.348, 0.319], ["on", 0.3516, 0.3097, 0.3647, 0.319], ["vibration", 0.3688, 0.3077, 0.4154, 0.319], ["damper", 0.4195, 0.3077, 0.46, 0.3216], ["and", 0.2705, 0.3243, 0.2908, 0.33